Relationship to Ansible
-----------------------
krikri-playbook is an independent reimplementation that aims to behave, and
print, exactly like ansible-core, selected Ansible collections, ansible-lint and
yamllint (all GPL-3.0-or-later). Their behavior, documentation and real output
(used as test oracles) informed this project, and some short messages and small
constant sets match upstream byte for byte for compatibility. krikri is licensed
GPL-3.0-or-later accordingly.

